<!-- 6 Agentic check -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="kicker">Innovation &middot; agentic re-identification check</div>
  <h1>A second model attacks the redaction before release</h1>
  <p class="lead">Detectors label spans. Privacy fails on combinations &mdash; a job title plus an island, a relative plus a date.
    So after redaction, the LLM is re-prompted as an adversary and given only what would be released.</p>
  <div class="grid2" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:start">
    <div class="card" style="background:#fff">
      <h3>How it works</h3>
      <ol style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.5;padding-left:20px;margin:6px 0 0">
        <li>Render the redacted page as text, exactly as a recipient would see it.</li>
        <li>Ask: <i>which remaining text could identify a specific person? how sure are you?</i></li>
        <li>Map each answer back to OCR boxes; plausibility checks reject ages, durations and form labels.</li>
        <li>High-confidence findings and quasi-identifiers with a uniqueness cue (<i>only, sole, 唯一, 現任</i>) are added automatically; the rest go to the reviewer.</li>
        <li>The page gets a 0&ndash;100 <b>re-identification risk</b>; the policy is re-applied.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div>
      <table class="t">
        <tr><th>Unseen documents (v3)</th><th>Recall</th><th>Precision</th><th>Clean pages</th></tr>
        <tr><td>Detectors only (C)</td><td>{{ "%.1f"|format(fin.v3.C_full.recall*100) }}%</td><td>{{ "%.1f"|format(fin.v3.C_full.precision*100) }}%</td><td>{{ "%.0f"|format(fin.v3.C_full.clean_doc_rate*100) }}%</td></tr>
        <tr class="hl"><td><b>+ agentic check (D)</b></td><td><b>{{ "%.1f"|format(fin.v3.D_agentic.recall*100) }}%</b></td><td><b>{{ "%.1f"|format(fin.v3.D_agentic.precision*100) }}%</b></td><td><b>{{ "%.0f"|format(fin.v3.D_agentic.clean_doc_rate*100) }}%</b></td></tr>
      </table>
      <div class="card" style="margin-top:14px">
        <h3>What it catches</h3>
        <ul><li>Names the detectors missed in OCR-garbled lines, propagated to every repeated mention.</li>
          <li>Quasi-identifiers: <i>"the only licensed ferry captain on Green Island"</i>.</li>
          <li>It costs one extra LLM call per page &mdash; affordable because the text model has a whole B70 to itself.</li></ul>
      </div>
      <p class="note" style="margin-top:8px">"Clean page" = zero leaked items &mdash; the number a compliance officer cares about.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="foot"><span>RedactAgent &middot; ASUS UGen AI League 2026 &middot; Final</span><span>6</span></div>
</section>

